{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/904609-lets-set-difficulty-for-assorted-miscelanious-tasks","id":904609,"title":"lets set Difficulty for assorted miscelanious tasks.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-31T18:15:14-07:00","id":904609,"title":"lets set Difficulty for assorted miscelanious tasks.","content":"Were all going to come accross it at some point... a case comes up that needs a dice roll but we cant find the right system to use.<br /> <br /> <br /> Thought we should come up with some things <br /> <br /> and mention any such cases we've run into<br /> <br /> Two cases I remember from a decade ago, one was a char acting as a midwife, I set the mothers Stamina roll at 8, but lets the midwifes roll lower the difficulty, was in dark ages, wanted to reflect how important medicine was back then.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> One side question is their a reason why Equipment bonuses, abound in Chronicles of Darkness but seem almost nonexistent in CWOD? <br /> <br /> Do they just not want to slight Red Talons for not buying CD Players to help them meditate or what?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T19:40:45-07:00","id":904659,"title":"","content":"My general tendency now is to set difficulty low in order to avoid dice rolling for non-opposed rolls, so I can allow automatic successes. I really try to think hard about how hard it is to fail at something. Most journeyman will have 4 or 5 die (Attributes plus Abilities). Talented professionals (lawyers, physicians) will have 6 die, 7 if they are specialists. Most routine tasks must allow automatic successes.<br /> <br /> So even though &quot;6' is the standard difficulty, I mainly use that for opposed rolls. I drop the difficulty for many things to 5 or even 4. If I think certain tasks should take a long time, I simply require multiple successes and allow people to roll in order to make it happen sooner.<br /> <br /> I actually find the WoD mechanics to be very clunky so I try to put it on autopilot as much as I can. I also recommend to my players to spend Willpower for automatic success as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T07:10:13-07:00","id":915579,"title":"","content":"There are certainly euipment bonus rules in oWoD - take a gun mounted scope which adds 2 dice to an aimed shot.<br /> <br /> I think the main reason that there are more solid rules for equipment adding bonus dice in Chonicles of Darkness is that the designers set a static difficulty number of 8. This means that you have to roll a lot more dice to achieve higher levels of success.<br /> <br /> So equipment bonuses are a more codifiedpart of the system.<br /> <br /> I'll add more about difficulties for tasks later- i really like this thread idea!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5525-rebelwithoutaclan","name":"RebelWithoutAClan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5525_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T17:46:14-07:00","id":924691,"title":"","content":"Oh a set of examples?<br /> <br /> Lets say two partys are in conflict, one wants to skewer teachings in school one way another wants it skewered the other way<br /> <br /> Or in a Newspaper, one wanting to ignor a story as irrelevent, to bury it, the other bring things to light.<br /> <br /> Ideas what they'd need to roll?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T18:56:20-07:00","id":924717,"title":"","content":"You need to preform an appendectomy in the back of an out of control pickup barreling down the road in a third world county and all you have is the unless bits of a Swiss army knife and some half dried rubber cement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T08:58:01-07:00","id":988265,"title":"","content":"oh just found out that it was possible to do conversion of a car, to electric,<br /> <br /> what difficulty would it probaly be.<br /> <br /> yes am Necroing this thread for the question as I think its very valid. as a lot of garou or their kin would be seeking to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attach